      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I need to practice my tones! Because I discovered that tones are too important!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "今天，我和小雨去吃饭。",
      "traditional": "今天，我和小雨去吃飯。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ hé xiǎo yǔ qù chī fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小雨问我“菜好吃吗”？",
      "traditional": "小雨問我“菜好吃嗎”？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ wèn wǒ cài hǎo chī ma",
      "english": "Today, me and Little Yu went for a meal."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我想到最近学的一个词——“美味”，就想试着用用看。",
      "traditional": "我想到最近學的一個詞——“美味”，就想試著用用看。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng dào zuì jìn xué de yí ge cí měi wèi jiù xiǎng shì zhe yòng yòng kàn",
      "english": "Little Yu asked me: “Does the food taste good?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I remembered a word I recently learned: “delicious”, and wanted to try using it."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "我对小雨说：“美味！”",
      "traditional": "我對小雨說：“美味！”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ duì xiǎo yǔ shuō měi wèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "可能是我发音发得不好，小雨听成了“没味”。",
      "traditional": "可能是我發音發得不好，小雨聽成了“沒味”。",
      "pinyin": "kě néng shì wǒ fā yīn fā de bù hǎo xiǎo yǔ tīng chéng le méi wèi",
      "english": "I said to Little Yu: “Delicious!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "她跑去帮我在我的菜里加了很多盐，",
      "traditional": "她跑去幫我在我的菜裡加了很多鹽，",
      "pinyin": "tā pǎo qù bāng wǒ zài wǒ de cài lǐ jiā le hěn duō yán",
      "english": "Perhaps I pronounced it wrong, but Little Yu instead heard “tasteless”."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "很好吃的菜变得好咸，一点儿也不好吃了。",
      "traditional": "很好吃的菜變得好鹹，一點兒也不好吃了。",
      "pinyin": "hěn hǎo chī de cài biàn de hǎo xián yì diǎn'r yě bù hǎo chī le",
      "english": "She ran off to help me add lots of salt in my food."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The delicious food then got very salty, and not tasty at all."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "经过这件事，让我知道中文里的声调有多重要！",
      "traditional": "經過這件事，讓我知道中文裡的聲調有多重要！",
      "pinyin": "jīng guò zhè jiàn shì ràng wǒ zhī dào zhōng wén lǐ de shēng diào yǒu duō zhòng yào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "声调不同，意思就不同。",
      "traditional": "聲調不同，意思就不同。",
      "pinyin": "shēng diào bù tóng yì si jiù bù tóng",
      "english": "This experience taught me how important the tones in Chinese are!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "我要好好练习声调，希望以后不要再出现这样的事情了。",
      "traditional": "我要好好練習聲調，希望以後不要再出現這樣的事情了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yào hǎo hǎo liàn xí shēng diào xī wàng yǐ hòu bú yào zài chū xiàn zhè yàng de shì qing le",
      "english": "If the tones are wrong, the meaning is also different."
    }
