    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben's Diary – I Must Practice Tones",
      "",
      "2018-02-08 – Cloudy",
      "",
      "I need to practice my tones! Because I discovered that tones are too important!",
      "",
      "Today, me and Little Yu went for a meal.",
      "Little Yu asked me: “Does the food taste good?”",
      "I remembered a word I recently learned: “delicious”, and wanted to try using it.",
      "",
      "I said to Little Yu: “Delicious!”",
      "Perhaps I pronounced it wrong, but Little Yu instead heard “tasteless”.",
      "She ran off to help me add lots of salt in my food.",
      "The delicious food then got very salty, and not tasty at all.",
      "",
      "This experience taught me how important the tones in Chinese are!",
      "If the tones are wrong, the meaning is also different.",
      "I must carefully practice my tones, and I hope something like this will never happen again."
    ]
  }
